<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Roshan's Portal - Sarkari Directory</title>
    
    <!-- Yahan se CSS start hoti hai -->
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #0d47a1;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        /* Container box for links */
        ul {
            list-style-type: none; /* Bullet points hata diye */
            padding: 0;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto; /* Screen ke center me lane ke liye */
        }

        /* Har ek service card ki styling */
        li {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        /* Direct Clickable Link ki styling */
        a {
            color: #1e88e5;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
            color: #0d47a1;
        }

        p {
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #888;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Roshan's Portal</h1>
    <div class="subtitle"><b>Sarkari Kam Ki Zaruri Websites</b></div>

    <ul>
        <li>
            <a href="https://uidai.gov.in/" target="_blank">Aadhaar Card Portal (UIDAI)</a>
            <p>Naya Aadhaar Card banana, Aadhaar update karna, aur status check karna.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://voters.eci.gov.in/" target="_blank">Voter ID Portal (Election Commission)</a>
            <p>Naya Voter ID Card apply karna, Voter ID download karna, aur Voter List dekhna.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://www.incometax.gov.in/" target="_blank">PAN Card / Income Tax Portal</a>
            <p>Naya PAN Card banana, PAN-Aadhaar Link karna, aur ITR bharna.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://parivahan.gov.in/" target="_blank">Parivahan Sewa Portal</a>
            <p>Driving License apply karna, Learning License test, aur RC ki jankari.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://mypassport.gov.in/" target="_blank">Passport Seva Portal</a>
            <p>Naya Passport apply karna, appointment book karna, aur status track karna.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://pmkisan.gov.in/" target="_blank">PM Kisan Samman Nidhi Portal</a>
            <p>Kisan kist ka status check karna, e-KYC karna, aur naya registration.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://sarkariresult.com/" target="_blank">Sarkari Result / Sarkari Naukri</a>
            <p>Nayi Sarkari Jobs, Admit Cards, Exam Dates, aur Results dekhna.</p>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <footer>
        <i>Note: Kisi bhi link par click karte hi website naye tab mein khul jayegi.</i>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
